      "subject": "Content and Collaboration ideas",
      "summary": "Good afternoon Stella, How are you? Just wanted to check in as we haven't spoken in about a week. I've been pretty busy lately. I spent a full day filming with ",
      "body": "Good afternoon Stella, How are you? Just wanted to check in as we haven't spoken in about a week. I've been pretty busy lately. I spent a full day filming with Max, so I now have a lot of content to edit and upload over the coming weeks. We're also talking about doing some future collaborations, which I think could make for some really strong content on the channel. Alongside that, I've got plans for some product reviews, tutorials, shorts and streaming, so there's plenty in the pipeline. I also wanted to follow up regarding the course. I've started putting it together and have already had the first session with the student. I was just wondering whether the Evo unit has been shipped to him yet and if you have the tracking number? Also, let me know when you have some free time. It would be great to catch up and go over the course together. Finally, a quick update on the Melbourne Junior tournament. The organiser has purchased a Chessnut Move and has been showing it off around the club, so that's been some nice promotion already. He's also shared the planned venue layout with me, including the booth location and visibility, giving us the best location right outside the playing hall. Since the event is still a few months away, I was wondering whether you'd be interested in having a pull-up banner made for the booth. If you're happy with the idea, I can contact a few local printing companies and get the dimensions and pricing. It looks like they'd cost around AUD $300–400. Looking forward to hearing from you! Regards, Wade Good afternoon Stella, How are you? Just wanted to check in as we haven&#39;t spoken in about a week. I&#39;ve been pretty busy lately. I spent a full day filming with Max, so I now have a lot of content to edit and upload over the coming weeks. We&#39;re also talking about doing some future collaborations, which I think could make for some really strong content on the channel. Alongside that, I&#39;ve got plans for some product reviews