AE, and If you feel it would be >> helpful, we would be happy to schedule an online meeting to discuss the >> partnership further. >> >> Thank you once again, and I look forward to your thoughts. >> >> Best regards, >> >> On Tue, Jul 7, 2026 at 2:52 PM Stella Zhuang > stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com> wrote: >> Dear Ammar, >> >> Thank you for your detailed proposal — it’s a well-structured opportunity >> and we’re genuinely interested in exploring a long-term collaboration with >> Al Ain Chess Club. >> Before we dive deeper, I’d like to understand how you envision this >> partnership. For example, what kind of involvement are you looking for from >> Chessnut? Do you have a rough scope or budget in mind? >> This would help us better assess how we can align with your needs and put >> together a more tailored proposal. >> Looking forward to your thoughts. >> >> Best, >> Stella >> Business Development Manager | Chessnut >> >> ------------------------------------------------------------------ >> 发件人：contact >> 发送时间：2026年7月5日(周日) 00:40 >> 收件人：\"stella.zhuang\" >> 主 题：Fwd: Sponsorship Opportunity - Al Ain Chess & Mind Games Club >> >> AI routed this ticket to Stella and forwarded a copy for visibility. >> Reason: The ticket is a sponsorship and long-term collaboration proposal >> from a chess club, which falls under partnership/collaboration routing >> handled by Stella. >> >> >> Best, >> Stella >> Business Development Manager | Chessnut >> On Sat, 4 Jul at 5:02 PM , Ammar sbahi wrote: >> Dear Chessnut Team, >> >> I hope you are doing well. >> >> My name is Ammar Sbahi, Marketing & Events Coordinator at Al Ain Chess & >> Mind Games Club. >> >> I am reaching out from our official club email to present a structured >> sponsorship opportunity for a long-term collaboration between Chessnut and >> our club. >> >> Al Ain Chess Club is one of the most active chess organizations in the >> UAE, currently organizing and participating in more than 40 chess events >> annually, including: