Al Ain - United Arab Emirates Dear Stella, I hope you&#39;re doing well. I just wanted to follow up on my previous email regarding the potential partnership between Chessnut and Al Ain Chess Club. We remain very interested in exploring this collaboration and would appreciate any updates regarding the sponsorship details when you have the opportunity. We look forward to hearing from you and hope to move forward together soon. Thank you for your time. On Wed, Jul 8, 2026 at 12:28 PM Ammar sbahi &lt; ammar@acmg.ae &gt; wrote: Dear Stella, Thank you for your thoughtful proposal and for taking the time to outline your vision for a long-term partnership. We truly appreciate the opportunity and believe this could be the beginning of a valuable collaboration between Chessnut and Al Ain Chess Club. We are very interested in the product sponsorship model and the pre-order distribution approach, especially as it allows us to introduce Chessnut products to our community without the need to hold inventory. Before moving forward, we would appreciate a few additional details regarding: The products included in the sponsorship (models and quantities). The estimated annual value of the sponsorship. Whether shipping costs to the UAE are covered by Chessnut. The distributor margin and ordering process. Whether the partnership is intended to be annual and include support for multiple tournaments and club activities throughout the year. Once we have these details, we will be pleased to discuss the next steps and work together to establish a successful long-term partnership. We look forward to your response and are excited about the potential opportunities this partnership can create for both Chessnut and Al Ain Chess Club. Best regards, Ammar Sbahi Marketing &amp; Events Coordinator Al Ain Chess &amp; Mind Games Club Landline: +971 3 763 3387 Mobile: +971 56 207 1929 Al Ain - United Arab Emirates On Wed, 8 Jul 2026 at 11:49 AM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Dear Ammar, Thanks for your detailed response — it’s clear you’ve put thought into this. On the financial sponsorship side, we’re not able to offer cash support, as Chessnut doesn’t currently have a direct sales channel in the Middle East. However, we do see a number of customers from the region reaching out to us, and they often have no easy way to purchase our products. What we’d like to propose instead is a product-based sponsorship model, combined with a distribution opportunity for your club. Here’s what we have in mind: We can provide product sponsorship — a full set of boards, tournament prizes, and ongoing event support — along with social media promotion and a distribution framework. You’d be able to offer Chessnut products to your community, including customers we refer from the region. To be clear, we’re not asking you to push sales. The idea is simply to give players and visitors a way to purchase if they become interested after trying the products at your events — a natural conversion, not a hard sell. To make this as low-risk as possible for you, there’s no need to hold inventory upfront. You can start with a pre-order model — collect a deposit from customers, place orders with us weekly, and we’ll ship accordingly. Once you see steady demand, we can revisit whether holding stock makes sense. In return, we’d ask for: - Logo placement on banners, marketing materials, and event backdrops - Brand visibility at tournaments and club activities throughout the year - Recognition as an official Chessnut distribution partner in the region - Opportunities for players and visitors to experience Chessnut products firsthand at your events Does this sound like something you’d be open to exploring? Looking forward to your thoughts. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Ammar sbahi &lt; ammar@acmg.ae &gt; 发送时间：2026年7月7日(周二) 23:28 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主 题：Re: Sponsorship Opportunity - Al Ain Chess &amp; Mind Games Club Dear Stella, Thank you for your thoughtful reply and for your interest in exploring a long-term collaboration with Al Ain Chess and Mind Games Club. Our vision is to build a long-term strategic partnership with Chessnut that supports the continued growth of chess in Al Ain and across the UAE. We are looking for a partnership that combines both financial sponsorship and product support. The financial sponsorship would help us organize tournaments, youth programs, community events, marketing activities, and improve the overall player experience. At the same time, we would be delighted to incorporate Chessnut smart boards and other Chessnut products into our tournaments, training sessions, and promotional activities. At this stage, we are open to discussing different sponsorship models and support levels. We would be pleased to hear Chessnut&#39;s recommendations regarding both financial sponsorship and product support, based on what you believe would be the best fit for a long-term partnership. We are confident we can develop a collaboration that delivers value for both organizations. In return, Chessnut would receive year-round brand exposure through: Logo placement on tournament banners, marketing materials, and event backdrops. Recognition across our social media channels and promotional campaigns. Brand visibility at tournaments and club activities throughout the year. The opportunity to showcase Chessnut products during events and allow players and visitors to experience them firsthand. Recognition as an official strategic partner of Al Ain Chess Club. We believe this partnership can create meaningful value for both Chessnut and the growing chess community in the UAE, and If you feel it would be helpful, we would be happy to schedule an online meeting to discuss the partnership further. Thank you once again, and I look forward to your thoughts. Best regards, On Tue, Jul 7, 2026 at 2:52 PM St