ard. Would you be open to providing a developer unit, or alternatively offering a developer discount? I believe this integration would benefit both Chessnut users and the Chessis community by making your boards compatible with another popular chess app. Thank you for your time, and I look forward to hearing from you. Best regards, Nikhil 123050:2750839",
