      "summary": "Dear Stella, Thank you for your thoughtful reply and for your interest in exploring a long-term collaboration with Al Ain Chess and Mind Games Club. Our vision ",
      "body": "Dear Stella, Thank you for your thoughtful reply and for your interest in exploring a long-term collaboration with Al Ain Chess and Mind Games Club. Our vision is to build a long-term strategic partnership with Chessnut that supports the continued growth of chess in Al Ain and across the UAE. We are looking for a partnership that combines both financial sponsorship and product support. The financial sponsorship would help us organize tournaments, youth programs, community events, marketing activities, and improve the overall player experience. At the same time, we would be delighted to incorporate Chessnut smart boards and other Chessnut products into our tournaments, training sessions, and promotional activities. At this stage, we are open to discussing different sponsorship models and support levels. We would be pleased to hear Chessnut's recommendations regarding both financial sponsorship and product support, based on what you believe would be the best fit for a long-term partnership. We are confident we can develop a collaboration that delivers value for both organizations. In return, Chessnut would receive year-round brand exposure through: - Logo placement on tournament banners, marketing materials, and event backdrops. - Recognition across our social media channels and promotional campaigns. - Brand visibility at tournaments and club activities throughout the year. - The opportunity to showcase Chessnut products during events and allow players and visitors to experience them firsthand. - Recognition as an official strategic partner of Al Ain Chess Club. We believe this partnership can create meaningful value for both Chessnut and the growing chess community in the UAE, and If you feel it would be helpful, we would be happy to schedule an online meeting to discuss the partnership further. Thank you once again, and I look forward to your thoughts. Best regards, On Tue, Jul 7, 2026 at 2:52 PM Stella Zhuang wrote: > Dear Ammar, > > Thank you for y