Branding presence across event materials and digital coverage > - Integration of Chessnut products in training and competition > environments > - Long-term visibility within the UAE chess community > > > *Audience & Reach* > Our events attract a diverse chess audience, including juniors, amateurs, > and competitive players, with continuous engagement from schools, > academies, and local chess communities. > > *Collaboration Vision* > We are looking to build a long-term strategic partnership rather than a > one-time activation, where Chessnut becomes an integrated part of our > growing chess ecosystem in the UAE. > > We would be happy to share a detailed proposal deck, event calendar, and > media insights if there is interest in moving forward. > > *You can also find coverage of our latest activities and events on our > official Instagram page: **https://www.instagram.com/acmgae/ > * > *Website:* *https://acmg.ae/ * > > Looking forward to your thoughts and the possibility of working together. > > Best regards, > > -- > Ammar Sbahi > Marketing & Events Coordinator > *Al Ain Chess & Mind Games Club* > Landline: +971 3 763 3387 > Mobile: +971 56 207 1929 > Al Ain - United Arab Emirates > > > 123344:2750839 > > -- *Ammar Sbahi*Marketing & Events Coordinator *Al Ain Chess & Mind Games Club* Landline: +971 3 763 3387 Mobile: +971 56 207 1929 Al Ain - United Arab Emirates Dear Stella, Thank you for your thoughtful reply and for your interest in exploring a long-term collaboration with Al Ain Chess and Mind Games Club. Our vision is to build a long-term strategic partnership with Chessnut that supports the continued growth of chess in Al Ain and across the UAE. We are looking for a partnership that combines both financial sponsorship and product support. The financial sponsorship would help us organize tournaments, youth programs, community events, marketing activities, and improve the overall player experience. At the same time, we would be delighted to incorporate Chessnut