    {
      "id": "08a26afaa47862b504cd",
      "threadId": "chessnut july updates – sale, companion & new app",
      "name": "Gadgetify",
      "email": "gadgetify@gmail.com",
      "subject": "Re: 回复：Chessnut July Updates – Sale, Companion & New App",
      "summary": "Thank you Stella! Right now, we are working on a comprehensive app that runs Stockfish 24/7 to find / come up with never seen before puzzles and studies. We hav",
      "body": "Thank you Stella! Right now, we are working on a comprehensive app that runs Stockfish 24/7 to find / come up with never seen before puzzles and studies. We have worked very hard on it, but we would love to be able to interface it with Chessnut and other boards! Any documentation that could help us is very much appreciated! Best, Cyrus Gadgetify On 7/7/2026 5:11 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote: > Hi Cyrus, > > Thanks for your message — glad to hear you’re excited about the Companion. > We can definitely add you to the list and send one over once we have > stock available. I’ll let you know as soon as it’s ready to ship. > As for the custom app development question — I’ll check with our tech > team and get back to you on that. > > Best, > Stella > Business Development Manager | Chessnut > > > ------------------------------------------------------------------ > 发件人：Gadgetify > 发送时间：2026年7月1日(周三) 06:03 > 收件人：Stella Zhuang > 主 题：Re: Chessnut July Updates – Sale, Companion & New App > > Hi Stella, > > Great update. We would love to test the Chessnut Companion if it > is possible. I think we won a prize from you for being one of the > most active Chessnut posters? If you need tons of videos for the > Chessnut Companion, we can certainly deliver on that. I think it > would go great with the Chessnut Move. We have done reviews of > DGT Pi in the past but this looks 100x times better. Very > exciting! One question: is it codable? Can we develop custom apps > for it? > > Kind Regards, > > Cyrus > > Gadgetify > > On 6/30/2026 5:39 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote: > Hi everyone, > > Long time no see — a few quick updates: > > 1. 6th Anniversary Sale (July 1–11) > 20% off storewide — your discount codes work too. We’ve been > running fewer discounts this year, so this is a good one to plan > content around. Good for board reviews, accessories, or anything > you want to feature. If you need us to boost anything, just send > the link. > > 2. Chessnut Companion Launch – July 3, 8:00 AM EST > First batch: 200 units at 20% off → $367.20. > Key features: > - AI coaching & real-time guidance > - Tournament-grade chess clock > - Voice control > - Works with Chess.com, Lichess, and more > - Motorized auto-switch > Compatible with all Chessnut boards except Evo. Only 200 units > available at this price, so it’s worth acting early. Interested? > Submit your content ideas — we’ll review them. > > 3. Chessnut Next – App Overhaul > We’re rolling out a completely redesigned app that turns the > Chessnut board into a full training ecosystem: > - Daily Task & Career mode — Gamified progression with tasks, > points, ELO, bosses, and challenges to keep you engaged every day. > - Maia3 integration — The latest human‑style AI engine helps you > understand why players at different levels tend to make certain > moves, not just what the best move is. > - Multiple analysis reports — Standard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and > Maia3 Human Review — so you can review the same game from three > angles: objective engine, coach-level explanation, and human‑style > insight. > - Progress tools — Mistake Book, themed puzzles, interactive > lessons, and Board Analyzer turn each game review into actionable > practice. > It’s currently in beta. If you’re interested in participating, > just let me know. > > Let me know if you have any questions! > > Best, > Stella > Business Development Manager | Chessnut > > --------------9XiBqM0D860lfWn0rcNG35de Content-Type: multipart/related; boundary=\"------------wKNzheWCWj1IL4Ie30mnnQ2k\" --------------wKNzheWCWj1IL4Ie30mnnQ2k Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8 Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit Thank you Stella! Right now, we are working on a comprehensive app that runs Stockfish 24/7 to find / come up with never seen before puzzles and studies. We have worked very hard on it, but we would love to be able to interface it with Chessnut and other boards! Any documentation that could help us is very much appreciated! Best, Cyrus Gadgetify On 7/7/2026 5:11 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote: Hi Cyrus, Thanks for your message — glad to hear you’re excited about the Companion. We can definitely add you to the list and send one over once we have stock available. I’ll let you know as soon as it’s ready to ship. As for the custom app development question — I’ll check with our tech team and get back to you on that. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Gadgetify &lt;gadgetify@gmail.com&gt; 发送时间：2026年7月1日(周三) 06:03 收件人：Stella Zhuang &lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt; 主 题：Re: Chessnut July Updates – Sale, Companion &amp; New App Hi Stella, Great update. We would love to test the Chessnut Companion if it is possible. I think we won a prize from you for being one of the most active Chessnut posters? If you need tons of videos for the Chessnut Companion, we can certainly deliver on that. I think it would go great with the Chessnut Move. We have done reviews of DGT Pi in the past but this looks 100x times better. Very exciting! One question: is it codable? Can we develop custom apps for it? Kind Regards, Cyrus Gadgetify On 6/30/2026 5:39 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote: Hi everyone, Long time no see — a few quick updates: 1. 6th Anniversary Sale (July 1–11) 20% off storewide — your discount codes work too. We’ve been running fewer discounts this year, so this is a good one to plan content around. Good for board reviews, accessories, or anything you want to feature. If you need us to boost anything, just send the link. 2. Chessnut Companion Launch – July 3, 8:00 AM EST First batch: 200 units at 20% off → $367.20. Key features: - AI coaching &amp; real-time guidance - Tournament-grade chess clock - Voice control - Works with Chess.com, Lichess, and more - Motorized auto-switch Compatible with all Chessnut boards except Evo. Only 200 units available at this price, so it’s worth acting early. Interested? Submit your content ideas — we’ll review them. 3. Chessnut Next – App Overhaul We’re rolling out a completely redesigned app that turns the Chessnut board into a full training ecosystem: - Daily Task &amp; Career mode — Gamified progression with tasks, points, ELO, bosses, and challenges to keep you engaged every day. - Maia3 integration — The latest human‑style AI engine helps you understand why players at different levels tend to make certain moves, not just what the best move is. - Multiple analysis reports — Standard / Stockfish, Grandeur, and Maia3 Human Review — so you can review the same game from three angles: objective engine, coach-level explanation, and human‑style insight. - Progress tools — Mistake Book, themed puzzles, interactive lessons, and Board Analyzer turn each game review into actionable practice. It’s currently in beta. If you’re interested in participating, just let me know. Let me know if you have any questions! Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut --------------wKNzheWCWj1IL4Ie30mnnQ2k Content-Type: image/png; name=\"temp4cj.png\" Content-Disposition: inline; filename=\"temp4cj.png\" Content-Id: Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64 iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAApoAAANwCAYAAACPpMqvAAAgAElEQVR4nOydeXRcxZX/v/16 71a31NosWau12bJkW5Ll3XjBGAPGCzH7hEBghi3kJGROMoFMZhJmJnOSyWSGBAayAYGwBDAE zGITg3FsbORdtiRLlmy0WNa+97693x8+t1z93LJFglh+uZ9zdCR1v/eqXlW9qm/de6ueDoAK hmGYzwCdTgdFUaCqKlT1bFekKAqi0aj42263Izc3FwUFBUhLS0N+fj7S0tKQk5ODzMxMJCYm YmxsDG+//TZ+9rOfoa+vD0ajUVwjGo1Cp9OJvxmGYZhPD8NnnQGGYf52IaEZDoeh0+nE/4qi wOVyoaCgADNnzkRVVRWqqqpQUlICq9WKEydOwOFwIDU1FUajEcePH8drr72GoaEhGAwGhEIh 6HQ6GI1GAICqqkJsMgzDMJ8eLDQZhvnMICumwWAQYtDpdCInJwdLlizBxo0bsXDhQpjNZoyM jKCrqwsdHR3YunUrqqursXjxYthsNnR1daGrqwvRaBQ2mw1+vx+qqgrraCQS+YzvlGEY5m8T FpoMw3xmkBXTZDLB7/fD5XJh48aNuP3221FRUYFoNAq3242Ojg688847ePLJJ9HS0gKdToeC ggLYbDa4XC4sWbIEt956K371q1/B5/MhISEBHo8HoVBICE7ZPc8wDMN8eqj8wz/8wz+T9aPX 6+N+riiKajabVavVqur1erWwsFB9+umn1YGBAVVVVTUSiagNDQ3qAw88oGZmZqo6nU61WCxq amqqmpiYqK5cuVJ94okn1K6uLlVVVTUYDKq1tbXqqlWrVIPBoKampqoWi