      "summary": "Hi Stella, Good news, thanks. Here are the details for shipping: Ryan Fenwick 07880 059244 28 Blackthorn Drive, Hurworth, DL2 2FU, United Kingdom On the Tax ID:",
      "body": "Hi Stella, Good news, thanks. Here are the details for shipping: Ryan Fenwick 07880 059244 28 Blackthorn Drive, Hurworth, DL2 2FU, United Kingdom On the Tax ID: I don't have one to give for a personal press shipment, so I'd suggest declaring it as a review sample or gift at low value, which normally clears UK customs without one. If your logistics team needs anything specific from my end to make that work, tell me what and I'll sort it. On timing, send it as soon as you can and we'll be fine. My hard copy deadline is 14th August, so as long as it reaches me a week or so before that, I've got time to give it a proper run. If shipping looks like it'll be tight, let me know the tracking once it's on its way, and I can plan around it. Best, Ryan Ryan Fenwick Sales Director Newsquest Media Group | LOCALiQ 07880 059244 newsquest.co.uk | localiq.co.uk [cid:a8644331-c45a-455d-be93-c1a9dc609b66] ________________________________ From: Stella Zhuang Sent: Tuesday, July 07, 2026 10:39 AM To: Ryan Fenwick Subject: 回复：Re: BUSINESSiQ September 2026 — Chessnut Move Editorial Review Request You don't often get email from stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com. Learn why this is important Hi Ryan, Thanks for reaching out — we’d be happy to provide a review unit. However, I’m not sure if it will arrive in time for your deadline, given the shipping time required. To move forward, could you please provide the following details so we can arrange the shipment? - Full name - Phone number - Shipping address - Postal code - Tax ID We’ll do our best to get it to you as soon as possible. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：contact 发送时间：2026年7月1日(周三) 14:11 收件人：\"stella.zhuang\" 主 题：Fwd: Re: BUSINESSiQ September 2026 — Chessnut Move Editorial Review Request 请查看由Ryan Fenwick（ryan.fenwick@localiq.co.uk）提出的工单#122480 。 此致， 何强 Chessnut客户服务代表 https://chessnutech.com On Tue, 30 Jun at 9:49 PM , Ryan Fenwick wrote: Hi, Following up on my note about featuring the Chessnut Move in the September edition of BUSINESSiQ. The slot is still open and I'd like to include it. With our copy deadline of 14th August approaching, I'd need a review unit in hand a couple of weeks before to give it a proper run. If it's easier, a quick yes or no on availability is all I need at this stage and I can work around the rest. In case it's useful again, a recent edition of the column is here: https://edition.pagesuite.com/html5/reader/production/default.aspx?pnum=154&edid=fe229502-f8ea-4df5-a8a3-9757cda8b488&isshared=true Best, Ryan Fenwick Ryan Fenwick Sales Director Newsquest Media Group | LOCALiQ 07880 059244 newsquest.co.uk | localiq.co.uk [https://outlook.office.com/mail/inbox/id/AAkALgAAAAAAHYQDEapmEc2byACqAC%2FEWg0AoM6bGzheCUWtEec3TOKdfwANF4%2Br4QAA?nativeVersion=1.2026.623.400] ________________________________ From: Ryan Fenwick Sent: Thursday, June 11, 2026 11:14 AM To: contact@chessnutech.com Subject: BUSINESSiQ September 2026 — Chessnut Move Editorial Review Request Hi, I'm Ryan Fenwick, tech columnist for BUSINESSiQ, the North East England quarterly business magazine. I'm building the tech section for our September 2026 edition and I'd like to consider the Chessnut Move for editorial inclusion. BUSINESSiQ reaches 5,000 copies per quarter — 71% of our readership are senior managers and directors. The intersection of technology and focus is a theme that runs through our tech coverage, and the Chessnut Move is a product I'd like to put in front of that audience properly. If it helps to see what the coverage looks like, a recent edition of the column is available to read online — take a look here . If you can provide a review unit along with any press materials and high-resolution imagery, please get in touch. Kind regards, Ryan Ryan Fenwick Sales Director Newsquest Media Group | LOCALiQ 07880 059244 newsquest.co.uk | localiq.co.uk [https://outlook.office.com/mail/inbox/id/AAkALgAAAAAAHYQDEapmEc2byACqAC%2FEWg0AoM6bGzheCUWtEec3TOKdfwANF4%2Br4QAA?nativeVersion=1.2026.623.400] -------------------------------------------------------------- Advertising: All advertising is accepted subject to our terms and conditions of advertising which can be found here https://www.newsquest.co.uk/terms-of-advertising Editorial: All content submitted, or licenced, to Newsquest is accepted pursuant to our Contributor Terms and Conditions https://www.newsquest.co.uk/contributor-terms This document is private and confidential. All property, copyright and other rights in it and its contents belong to Newsquest Media Group Limited. It must not be read, copied, disclosed or otherwise used without Newsquest’s authorisation. Newsquest may exercise its legal rights and remedies in the event of any such unauthorised use. Newsquest Media Group Limited. Registered in England, number 01676637. Registered office: The Echo Building, 18 Albert Road, Bournemouth, England BH1 1BZ. -------------------------------------------------------------- 122480:2750839 -------------------------------------------------------------- Advertising: All advertising is accepted subject to our terms and conditions of advertising which can be found here https://www.newsquest.co.uk/terms-of-advertising Editorial: All content submitted, or licenced, to Newsquest is accepted pursuant to our Contributor Terms and Conditions https://www.newsquest.co.uk/contributor-terms This document is private and confidential. All property, copyright and other rights in it and its contents belong to Newsquest Media Group Limited. It must not be read, copied, disclosed or otherwise used without Newsquest’s authorisation. Newsquest may exercise its legal rights and remedies in the event of any such unauthorised use. Newsquest Media Group Limited. Registered in England, number 01676637. Registered office: The Echo Building, 18 Albert Road, Bournemouth, England BH1 1BZ. --------------------------------------------------------------