      "body": "Good afternoon Stella, Please find attached the breakdown of my travel expenses for reimbursement from the recent trip. For clarity, as we generally operate in USD and the expenses were incurred across multiple foreign currencies, I have included the final reimbursement total in USD to avoid any confusion. The USD figure below has been converted using the current exchange rate of approximately *1 AUD = 0.6938 USD*. *Travel Costs* - Sydney → Taiwan: AUD $1,392.89 - Taiwan → Hong Kong: AUD $400.44 - Thailand → Sydney: AUD $675.00 *(I had originally booked a Hong Kong → Sydney flight. However, after changing my travel plans, I was able to obtain a refund and rebook my return from Thailand at a lower cost.)* - Airport Transfer: AUD $92.00 - Airport Transfer: AUD $100.00 Total (AUD): $2,660.33 *Total (USD): $1,845.20* Regarding meal reimbursements, as a Hong Kong meal allowance was provided in advance and a number of meals were supplied throughout the trip, I don't believe it is necessary to go through my receipts to determine whether I incurred any additional eligible meal expenses. As such, I won't be claiming any meal reimbursement for this trip. Please find the relevant travel receipts attached. I'd also like to take this opportunity to thank you and the entire Chessnut team for being such wonderful hosts throughout my travels. I really appreciate all of the support and hospitality, and it made the trip an enjoyable and memorable experience. Kind regards, Wade Good afternoon Stella, Please find attached the breakdown of my travel expenses for reimbursement from the recent trip. For clarity, as we generally operate in USD and the expenses were incurred across multiple foreign currencies, I have included the final reimbursement total in USD to avoid any confusion. The USD figure below has been converted using the current exchange rate of approximately 1 AUD = 0.6938 USD . Travel Costs Sydney → Taiwan: AUD $1,392.89 Taiwan → Hong Kong: AUD $400.44 Thailan