erything is ok. I was concerned. I have the new email now, so hopefully that will help with communication. Thank you for your response. Take Care!EdSent from my Galaxy Hi Stella,&nbsp; I am so glad that you liked the video. It was fun to get creating again.&nbsp; Yes, I am using some new equipment. I have a DJI Osmo I purchased to help improve the videos and to give me more freedom to experiment with different shots. I also have 2 DJI mics which help a great deal. It was great to hear back from you so quickly. Thanks again! Take Care! Ed Sent from my Galaxy -------- Original message -------- From: Stella Zhuang &lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt; Date: 6/30/26 2:27 AM (GMT-05:00) To: detailz95@aol.com Subject: 回复：MOVE Review Hi Ed, I really enjoyed the video — welcome back! I noticed the footage looks much sharper — did you get a new camera? I’ve always admired how quickly you pick up new technology and really understand it. Please take care of yourself! Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：detailz95@aol.com &lt;detailz95@aol.com&gt; 发送时间：2026年6月30日(周二) 00:22 收件人：\"stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com\"&lt;stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com&gt; 抄 送：EDWARD MAHONEY&lt;detailz95@aol.com&gt; 主 题：Re: MOVE Review Hi Stella, I got back in front of the camera after my surgery, and it feels good. I am glad to be back up and running with the videos and basically my life. I got my Chesssnut MOVE video review released today. I have several ideas for future videos upcoming. I hope you enjoy the video. It was a little longer than I intended, but I wanted to be thorough.&nbsp; The video is attached. I hope you are doing well! Take Care! Ed Chessnut MOVE Review On Tuesday, May 26, 2026 at 02:50:55 PM EDT, detailz95@aol.com &lt;detailz95@aol.com&gt; wrote: Hi Stella, I just put together a short of my Chessnut Move online gameplay video. I wanted to get something out before my review of the Move. I love the 