o let you know in case something had gone wrong > with the shipment. > > Also, great to hear about the Chessnut Updates emails, they were really > helpful, so I’m glad they’ll be coming back :) > > Best, > Ivan > > El jue, 25 jun 2026 a las 12:26, Stella Zhuang ( stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com>) escribió: > >> Hi Ivan， >> >> Could you please forward the customs tax receipt you received? That would >> help us check with the carrier on our end. >> >> ------------------------------------------------------------------ >> 发件人：Stella Zhuang >> 发送时间：2026年6月25日(周四) 18:12 >> 收件人：Resourchess >> 主 题：回复：Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation >> >> Hi Ivan, >> >> Thanks for letting us know, we really appreciate it. This customs charge >> doesn’t seem right, and we’ll look into it with the carrier right away. If >> we can’t get it refunded, we’ll reimburse you directly.I’m also really >> glad to hear you find the ‘Chessnut Updates’ emails helpful. I’ll make sure >> to resume them as soon as possible. >> >> Best, >> Stella >> Business Development Manager | Chessnut >> >> ------------------------------------------------------------------ >> 发件人：Resourchess >> 发送时间：2026年6月24日(周三) 23:27 >> 收件人：Stella Zhuang >> 主 题：Re: Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation >> >> Hi Stella, >> >> I hope you’re doing great! >> >> I just wanted to let you know that the Chessnut Companion arrived safely, >> and it looks amazing. The “Resourchess” engraving is such a great detail. >> Thank you again, I really appreciate it 😃 >> >> I’ll start creating content with it on my social media in the next few >> days, and hopefully some YouTube content soon as well. >> >> Also, I wanted to mention that I had to pay €25.38 in customs fees to >> receive it. It’s not a problem at all, and I understand it wasn’t >> intentional, but I just wanted to let you know in case it also happens with >> other partners, and there's anything that can be done to prevent it.Maybe >> some import/export rules have changed recently? >> >> One more quick question: are you planning to continue sending the >> “Chessnut Updates” emails? They were really useful for knowing current >> promotions or upcoming campaigns and planning content around them. No >> problem if they’re paused, I just wanted to check. >> >> Thanks again for the Companion and the engraving! >> >> Best, >> Ivan >> >> El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 12:38, Resourchess ( ) >> escribió: >> Hi Stella, >> >> Wow, thank you so much for the engraving, that’s such a cool detail! >> >> I think simply “ *Resourchess *” would look really clean and elegant :) >> >> Thank you very very much! >> Ivan >> >> El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 11:09, Stella Zhuang ( > stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com>) escribió: >> Hi Ivan, >> >> Thanks again for your high recognition of Chessnut. I really appreciate >> it. >> Regarding the details of how it works and what's included, I'm still >> organizing the information. I will share a brief with you later so you can >> have a better understanding. >> Also, I'd like to laser engrave your name on it just to make it special. >> What would you like it to say? >> >> Best, >> Stella >> Business Development Manager | Chessnut >> >> ------------------------------------------------------------------ >> 发件人：Resourchess >> 发送时间：2026年5月20日(周三) 01:33 >> 收件人：Stella Zhuang >> 主 题：Re: Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation >> >> Hi Stella, >> >> That sounds super interesting, I’d love to try it out! It sounds like a >> great addition to the ecosystem. >> >> Would it be possible to get a bit of a sneak peek into what it includes >> or how it works? I’m really curious about it, especially since I’ve >> genuinely loved all the innovations you’ve released so far :) >> >> I can confirm *the shipping address is correct*. You can send it there. >> >> Thanks a lot for thinking of me, looking forward to testing it! >> Ivan >> >> El mar, 19 may 2026 a las 12:29, Stella Zhuang ( > stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com>) escribió: >> Hi Ivan, >> >> I'd like to send you Chessnut's new product, the Chessnut Companion. It's >> not a board itself, but the perfect companion to use with one. Together, >> they unlock more chess apps and include an AI coach to help improve your >> game. >> >> If you're interested, could you please confirm your shipping address >> below? >> >> Name: Ivan Paquico Rodriguez >> Address: Arcadi Balaguer 53, 3º, 1º >> City: Castelldefels >> Province: Barcelona >> Post Code: 08860 >> Country: Spain >> Phone: +34 660 638 967 >> >> Best, >> Stella >> Business Development Manager | Chessnut >> >> Hi Stella, I just received another email from FedEx with what appears to be the official customs duties and tax invoice, so I’m attaching the PDF in case it helps with your investigation. One thing I found a bit confusing is that the invoice says the amount is still unpaid. However, I already paid the customs fees before the package was delivered. In fact, I received the FedEx payment confirmation email, which included the receipt number and payment reference that I sent you previously. Also, when I log into the FedEx payment portal, it won&#39;t let me pay again because it says the payment has already been made. So I suspect the invoice status may simply not have been updated yet, or there may be some delay in their system. Hopefully this document helps clarify things with the carrier. If you need anything else from my side, just let me know and I&#39;ll be happy to help. Best, Ivan El jue, 25 jun 2026 a las 13:24, Resourchess (&lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt;) escribió: Hi Stella, I don’t seem to have a separate customs tax receipt, but I do have the FedEx payment confirmation email . If you want, I can forward it to you. It says “Please keep this email as proof of payment” and includes the amount paid, tracking ID and receipt number: Amount paid: EUR 25.38 Tracking ID: 872987813720 Receipt number: 93906938 I’m attaching a screenshot of the email, as well as the documents I was able to download from https://fit.clearance.fedex.com/ in a zip file, including the proof of delivery. I couldn’t download any invoice from there because it says “payment pending”, although if I try to pay again, it says “You have already made the payment”, so I’m honestly a bit confused. If I can help with anything else, just let me know. Sorry I can’t provide anything more specific, but I’ve looked everywhere on their platform and couldn’t find anything else. And thank you so much for looking into it. Please don’t worry too much about it, I just wanted to let you know in case something had gone wrong with the shipment. Also, great to hear about the Chessnut Updates emails, they were really helpful, so I’m glad they’ll be coming back :) Best, Ivan El jue, 25 jun 2026 a las 12:26, Stella Zhuang (&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt;) escribió: Hi Ivan， Could you please forward the customs tax receipt you received? That would help us check with the carrier on our end. ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年6月25日(周四) 18:12 收件人：Resourchess&lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt; 主 题：回复：Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation Hi Ivan, Thanks for letting us know, we really appreciate it. This customs charge doesn’t seem right, and we’ll look into it with the carrier right away. If we can’t get it refunded, we’ll reimburse you directly. I’m also really glad to hear you find the ‘Chessnut Updates’ emails helpful. I’ll make sure to resume them as soon as possible. Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Resourchess &lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年6月24日(周三) 23:27 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主 题：Re: Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation Hi Stella, I hope you’re doing great! I just wanted to let you know that the Chessnut Companion arrived safely, and it looks amazing. The “Resourchess” engraving is such a great detail. Thank you again, I really appreciate it 😃 I’ll start creating content with it on my social media in the next few days, and hopefully some YouTube content soon as well. Also, I wanted to mention that I had to pay €25.38 in customs fees to receive it. It’s not a problem at all, and I understand it wasn’t intentional, but I just wanted to let you know in case it also happens with other partners, and there&#39;s anything that can be done to prevent it.Maybe some import/export rules have changed recently? One more quick question: are you planning to continue sending the “Chessnut Updates” emails? They were really useful for knowing current promotions or upcoming campaigns and planning content around them. No problem if they’re paused, I just wanted to check. Thanks again for the Companion and the engraving! Best, Ivan El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 12:38, Resourchess (&lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt;) escribió: Hi Stella, Wow, thank you so much for the engraving, that’s such a cool detail! I think simply “ Resourchess ” would look really clean and elegant :) Thank you very very much! Ivan El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 11:09, Stella Zhuang (&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt;) escribió: Hi Ivan, Thanks again for your high recognition of Chessnut. I really appreciate it. Regarding the details of how it works and what&#39;s included, I&#39;m still organizing the information. I will share a brief with you later so you can have a better understanding. Also, I&#39;d like to laser engrave your name on it just to make it special. What would you like it to say? Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Resourchess &lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年5月20日(周三) 01:33 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主 题：Re: Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation Hi Stella, 