E across all of our brand partnerships, and our community has really come to know and trust it. If you are able to set us up with SUNNYLOVE as a coupon and affiliate code, we would love to understand the discount and commission breakdown on your end so we can start building out a strategy around it. > > Thank you again for sending these boards. We are so excited about what we can build together, and we cannot wait to show it to Howie! > > Warm regards, > Tammy > > On Jun 2, 2026, at 6:17 PM, Black Media Partnerships wrote: > > Hi Stella! > > Thank you so much for updating us on the shipment. We have received it safely and can’t wait to open them up and get everything set up. We truly appreciate it and will be in touch soon! > > Warmest regards, > Tammy > > On Jun 2, 2026, at 12:59 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote: > > > Hi Tammy, > > Both the wooden and plastic Move boards have been sent. Tracking number: 1Z4E2W090327952423. Carrier: UPS. > > Best, > Stella > Business Development Manager | Chessnut > > > ------------------------------------------------------------------ > 发件人：BlackMedia Partnerships > 发送时间：2026年5月7日(周四) 16:25 > 收件人：Stella Zhuang > 主 题：Re: Chessnut // BlackMediaPresents - Partnership Inquiry > > Hi Stella, > > Hope you have been doing well! We are still very much looking forward to receiving the chess boards as soon as they are available. I wanted to take a moment to share some exciting updates from the studio! > > Since we last spoke, we have had some incredible guests come through, including Joey Fatone from *NSYNC and Academy Award winner Billy Bob Thornton, who was even photographed with Sunny's Signature Ukulele. We would have absolutely loved to have had your chess board on display! > > Please do keep us posted on availability! > > Warmest regards, > Tammy > > Billy Bob Thornton of Landman, Bad Santa, Sling Blade > > > Joey Fatone of *NSYNC > > > On Apr 23, 2026, at 10:50 AM, Black Media Partnerships wrote: > > Hi Stella, > > Thank you so much! We are l