ight fit for both sides. We have two options depending on what works best for Chessnut: Option A: Performance-Based Partnership A 20% affiliate commission with no flat fee. This is our partnership track, where we are both fully invested in driving sales. You pay nothing upfront, and we are motivated to push the product through our social media channels because our earnings are tied directly to performance. Option B: Guaranteed Content Package A 5% affiliate commission plus a flat fee of $4,000 per dedicated short-form video. This option gives you guaranteed, high-quality content delivered to our combined audience of 1.9 million followers across Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, and YouTube, regardless of conversion. It also includes the organic celebrity and press exposure we have access to through Howie Mandel's studio, which is something truly unique to us. One additional benefit worth mentioning: through our access at Howie Mandel's studio, celebrity content opportunities come up organically. When they do, we will reach out with the details and give you the option to add it on as a dedicated piece of content. Two of the primary celebrity formats would be 1) when a celebrity engages with and responds to seeing Chessnut in action in real time, and 2) product gifting videos, where we demonstrate the board and gift a Chessnut to the celebrity on camera (this requires having a small stock on hand). The gifting format in particular tends to create warm, heartfelt moments that highlight the product naturally, and often results in the celebrity posting about it on their own channels at a later date, extending the reach of the content well beyond our own audience. These opportunities typically start at $10,000, and as a partner we would offer those to you at a reduced rate.&nbsp; Both options come with our full creative investment and the SUNNYLOVE affiliate code active and promoted across our content and community. We would love to hear which structure feels like the best fit