      "body": "Hi Stella, It was nice to meet you in Hong Kong. I hope your team had a fruitful trip. If there's any way I can help with Chessnut in the future, please let me know. As a Chinese American, I've really appreciated collaborating with people from both China and the US in chess. In the past, I've done some Chinese/English translation, media work, and event planning, if any of those would be useful. All the best to you! Jonathan Hi Stella, It was nice to meet you in Hong Kong. I hope your team had a fruitful trip. If there&#39;s any way I can help with Chessnut in the future, please let me know. As a Chinese American, I&#39;ve really appreciated collaborating with people from both China and the US in chess. In the past, I&#39;ve done some Chinese/English translation, media work, and event planning, if any of those would be useful. All the best to you! Jonathan %PDF-1.4 %���� 1 0 obj > endobj 3 0 obj > endobj 4 0 obj > endobj 10 0 obj > stream x��}�$9r��~��\u0002\u001b˸0H\u0002�\u0005f��\u0005\u0001^���\u0005��\u00050$Öe��oDu���*F&Ɋ��+\u001d�4Ss2�L&\u0019��/�%��\u0001_�Ki����?@ɷ����\u001f����������˿��?������`�W�\u0017LY_��\u001f?�Ӈ�vw�B/H ��ڪ]�~Hv�/���Zb���}��?����~zI/��/�>~H/X� !���$���\u000f׻�d��D��~�����p�F%U�v�ퟝ��6\u0010�:s;�v�\u0006���}�g�v�\u0019�I%9}/w7��M_�K&\u0005�9�\u0017T����uR� � ��Wg�1A�IΏ�^� �h+ G\u0005����z�r�_w�D���`iF\u001b\u0002�ҴN/�C\u0015gx��֍N���@zQ�U���B���:G\u0015g�6��8��- G��0�o\u001b?'/Y:��� ݊���n��~��������J���:~�z����b���E��Cܔ\\�=�����i�g\u0015\u001f�\"27�+^�X�B��ٖo��\u0016��3+�Co�\u0017�\u0018�nsL5{X$g\u0014�e�A���u=!^�]\u0006�Me ��JR�\u001fLO��\u0017�^6��!�b\u001b����ְ�3�ݛ�(���tt�6z�B�\u001f���'�\u0006lWY�M�g�V4k�\"���X��B� y�\u0006�%�|\u0016\"�\u0015���I0�_��Ǣ\u0003\u001f�P���\u0016�>��$H�\"Om) %k��\u001e\u0003\u0007��u\u0007�\u001b~���\u001aE��9%Ь[��n\\\u001f��2�D���\u0016ee��Zbs\u0019�ʆ\u001e|\u001c֧]\\���r�~\u0004� �ڞ�\u0019�4�$[U�x����Y���H\u0010]�cD@��\u0006E\"���\u001cy�\u0003'@�\\�N�E>>�U\u0003&.�\u001eo