      "body": "Hi Stella, Thanks for the update and for the brief! I haven't received the Companion yet, so it would be great if you could track it for me. I'll start planning the content from the brief in the meantime. Thank you! *Kind regards,* *Alexandra Samaganova* *https://linktr.ee/asamaganova * On Thu, Jun 25, 2026 at 2:10 PM Stella Zhuang wrote: > Hi everyone, > > I hope this email finds you well! > > 1. Have you received the Chessnut Companion yet? If you have, we’d love to > hear your first impressions! If not, please let us know and we’ll track it > for you. > > 2. Please find attached the Companion brief for your reference. It covers > the key selling points, suggested content angles, and video requirements — > feel free to use it as a guide for your upcoming content. > > 3. A quick note on the AI Coach feature: it’s not fully ready just yet and > is currently expected to be completed around next week. You can hold off on > filming that part until it’s ready. > > 4. Also, a new version of the app will be launching soon with several > updated sections. Stay tuned — we’ll share more details when it’s live. > > Let us know if you have any questions! > > Best, > Stella > Business Development Manager | Chessnut > Hi Stella, Thanks for the update and for the brief! I haven&#39;t received the Companion yet, so it would be great if you could track it for me. I&#39;ll start planning the content from the brief in the meantime. Thank you! Kind regards, Alexandra Samaganova https://linktr.ee/asamaganova On Thu, Jun 25, 2026 at 2:10 PM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hi everyone, I hope this email finds you well! 1. Have you received the Chessnut Companion yet? If you have, we’d love to hear your first impressions! If not, please let us know and we’ll track it for you. 2. Please find attached the Companion brief for your reference. It covers the key selling points, suggested content angles, and video requirements — feel free to use it as a guide for your upcoming content. 3. A quick note on the AI Coach feature: it’s not fully ready just yet and is currently expected to be completed around next week. You can hold off on filming that part until it’s ready. 4. Also, a new version of the app will be launching soon with several updated sections. Stay tuned — we’ll share more details when it’s live. Let us know if you have any questions! Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut",
      "bodyEnglish": "Hi Stella, Thanks for the update and for the brief! I haven't received the Companion yet, so it would be great if you could track it for me. I'll start planning the content from the brief in the meantime. Thank you! *Kind regards,* *Alexandra Samaganova* *https://linktr.ee/asamaganova * On Thu, Jun 25, 2026 at 2:10 PM Stella Zhuang wrote: > Hi everyone, > > I hope this email finds you well! > > 1. Have you received the Chessnut Companion yet? If you have, we’d love to > hear your first impressions! If not, please let us know and we’ll track it > for you. > > 2. Please find attached the Companion brief for your reference. It covers > the key selling points, suggested content angles, and video requirements — > feel free to use it as a guide for your upcoming content. > > 3. A quick note on the AI Coach feature: it’s not fully ready just yet and > is currently expected to be completed around next week. You can hold off on > filming that part until it’s ready. > > 4. Also, a new version of the app will be launching soon with several > updated sections. Stay tuned — we’ll share more details when it’s live. > > Let us know if you have any questions! > > Best, > Stella > Business Development Manager | Chessnut > Hi Stella, Thanks for the update and for the brief! I haven&#39;t received the Companion yet, so it would be great if you could track it for me. I&#39;ll start planning the content from the brief in the meantime. Thank you! Kind regards, Alexandra Samaganova https://linktr.ee/asamaganova On Thu, Jun 25, 2026 at 2:10 PM Stella Zhuang &lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; wrote: Hi everyone, I hope this email finds you well! 1. Have you received the Chessnut Companion yet? If you have, we’d love to hear your first impressions! If not, please let us know and we’ll track it for you. 2. Please find attached the Companion brief for your reference. It covers the key selling points, suggested content angles, and video requirements — feel free to use