ontent with it on my social media in the next few days, and hopefully some YouTube content soon as well. Also, I wanted to mention that I had to pay €25.38 in customs fees to receive it. It’s not a problem at all, and I understand it wasn’t intentional, but I just wanted to let you know in case it also happens with other partners, and there&#39;s anything that can be done to prevent it.Maybe some import/export rules have changed recently? One more quick question: are you planning to continue sending the “Chessnut Updates” emails? They were really useful for knowing current promotions or upcoming campaigns and planning content around them. No problem if they’re paused, I just wanted to check. Thanks again for the Companion and the engraving! Best, Ivan El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 12:38, Resourchess (&lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt;) escribió: Hi Stella, Wow, thank you so much for the engraving, that’s such a cool detail! I think simply “ Resourchess ” would look really clean and elegant :) Thank you very very much! Ivan El mié, 20 may 2026 a las 11:09, Stella Zhuang (&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt;) escribió: Hi Ivan, Thanks again for your high recognition of Chessnut. I really appreciate it. Regarding the details of how it works and what&#39;s included, I&#39;m still organizing the information. I will share a brief with you later so you can have a better understanding. Also, I&#39;d like to laser engrave your name on it just to make it special. What would you like it to say? Best, Stella Business Development Manager | Chessnut ------------------------------------------------------------------ 发件人：Resourchess &lt; hola@resourchess.com &gt; 发送时间：2026年5月20日(周三) 01:33 收件人：Stella Zhuang&lt; stella.zhuang@chessnutech.com &gt; 主 题：Re: Chessnut Companion – New Product Collaboration Invitation Hi Stella, That sounds super interesting, I’d love to try it out! It sounds like a great addition to the ecosystem. Would it be possible to get a bit of a sneak peek into what it i