del's studio, celebrity content opportunities come up organically. When they do, we will reach out with the details and give you the option to add it on as a dedicated piece of content. Two of the primary celebrity formats would be 1) when a celebrity engages with and responds to seeing Chessnut in action in real time, and 2) product gifting videos, where we demonstrate the board and gift a Chessnut to the celebrity on camera (this requires having a small stock on hand). The gifting format in particular tends to create warm, heartfelt moments that highlight the product naturally, and often results in the celebrity posting about it on their own channels at a later date, extending the reach of the content well beyond our own audience. These opportunities typically start at $10,000, and as a partner we would offer those to you at a reduced rate. > > Both options come with our full creative investment and the SUNNYLOVE affiliate code active and promoted across our content and community. > > We would love to hear which structure feels like the best fit on your end, and we are happy to talk through either option in more detail. > > Warmest regards, > Tammy > > On Jun 10, 2026, at 12:53 AM, Stella Zhuang wrote: > > Hi Tammy, > > Thanks for reaching out, Tammy. Really glad to hear how excited you are about the Chessnut Move! > > Yes, we do have an affiliate program, and you're very welcome to join. You can sign up through Uppromote, which is the platform we use to manage and track affiliate sales. > > Here's the registration link: > https://af.uppromote.com/Chessnutech/register > > Once you're in, you can create your own discount code. You're welcome to name it SUNNYLOVE. The code will offer a 12% discount (our official site discount is 10%), and you'll earn a 5% commission on sales generated through your code. Commissions are paid out at the beginning of each month. > > Let me know if you run into any issues during sign-up. Happy to help! > > Best, > Stella > Business Deve