      "body": "Dear Stella, Thank you for the quick response! I am very excited about your interest in collaborating. To give you more details about the event: I am the official organizer of the Marianczello Decade Series —a prestigious cycle of 10 tournaments celebrating Marianczello&#39;s 10th anniversary of chess content creation. He is the biggest chess YouTuber in Poland, with a community of over 150,000 subscribers and 50,000 members in our Chess.com Chess.com club. Initially, I mentioned a single board, but after finalizing the tournament structure, we would love to upgrade this to a partnership involving 3 Chessnut boards . This will allow us to create a massive buzz and maximize the marketing value for Chessnut across the entire 10-tournament cycle: 1st Board: The ultimate Grand Prix prize for the overall winner of the Decade Series. 2nd Board: The prize for the runner-up (2nd place) in the final standings. 3rd Board: A grand raffle prize for all participants. At the end of the series, we will host a big giveaway drawing from everyone who played, which is the perfect tool to keep everyday amateur players highly engaged and active from the first to the very last tournament. In exchange for these 3 boards, we will provide an extensive promotional campaign: Club Homepage Banner: A prominent Chessnut banner on our main Chess.com Chess.com club page for the entire duration of the series. Dedicated Articles &amp; Newsletters: Official tournament announcements on Chess.com Chess.com with direct links to your store, sent to our 50,000 club members. YouTube Video Integration: Marianczello will personally provide dedicated sponsor shoutouts, mention your brand in his videos, and include direct links in the descriptions of his tournament coverage videos on YouTube. This setup ensures high, long-term player engagement and puts Chessnut products directly in front of thousands of passionate Polish chess players for months. Please let me know if this expanded package works for you! Best regards, Krzysztof Dettlaff Tournament Organizer www.chess.com https://www.chess.com/events/info/marianczello-decade-series m.youtube.com https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=41iJsK6L7mI 1:20 Last video and Youtuber talk about tournament and sponsors :) --10FKNUMBIQJAWEQPSMBTDUnhgwp Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8 Dear Stella, Thank you for the quick response! I am very excited about your interest in collaborating. To give you more details about the event: I am the official organizer of the Marianczello Decade Series —a prestigious cycle of 10 tournaments celebrating Marianczello's 10th anniversary of chess content creation. He is the biggest chess YouTuber in Poland, with a community of over 150,000 subscribers and 50,000 members in our Chess.com club. Initially, I mentioned a single board, but after finalizing the tournament structure, we would love to upgrade this to a partnership involving 3 Chessnut boards . This will allow us to create a massive buzz and maximize the marketing value for Chessnut across the entire 10-tournament cycle: 1st Board: The ultimate Grand Prix prize for the overall winner of the Decade Series. 2nd Board: The prize for the runner-up (2nd place) in the final standings. 3rd Board: A grand raffle prize for all participants. At the end of the series, we will host a big giveaway drawing from everyone who played, which is the perfect tool to keep everyday amateur players highly engaged and active from the first to the very last tournament. In exchange for these 3 boards, we will provide an extensive promotional campaign: Club Homepage Banner: A prominent Chessnut banner on our main Chess.com club page for the entire duration of the series. Dedicated Articles &amp; Newsletters: Official tournament announcements on Chess.com with direct links to your store, sent to our 50,000 club members. YouTube Video Integration: Marianczello will personally provide dedicated sponsor shoutouts, mention your brand in his videos, and include direct links in the descriptions of his tournament coverage videos on YouTube. This setup ensures high, long-term player engagement and puts Chessnut products directly in front of thousands of passionate Polish chess players for months. Please let me know if this expanded package works for you! Best regards, Krzysztof Dettlaff Tournament Organizer https://www.chess.com/events/info/marianczello-decade-series https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=41iJsK6L7mI 1:20 Last video and Youtuber talk about tournament and sponsors :) --10FKNUMBIQJAWEQPSMBTDUnhgwp-- --3LJWWMVVUFRHVHAIHTFCRnhgwp Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=\"=?utf-8?b?ZmlsZV8wMDAwMDAwMGZhZTg3MjBhOTJkNjBkYzg5ODliZmRhMi5wbmc=?=\" Content-Id: Content-Transfer-Encoding: base64 Content-Type: image/png iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAABgAAAAQACAIAAACoEwUVAABhWmNhQlgAAGFaanVtYgAAAB5qdW1k YzJwYQARABCAAACqADibcQNjMnBhAAAAYTRqdW1iAAAAR2p1bWRjMm1hABEAEIAAAKoAOJtxA3Vy bjpjMnBhOjMxNWQ0ZDU2LTQ0MzctNDVjMi1hZjgxLThhNDIxNjg5MjE2OQAAABf9anVtYgAAAClq dW1kYzJhcwARABCAAACqADibcQNjMnBhLmFzc2VydGlvbnMAAAAJ0Wp1bWIAAAA7anVtZEDLDDK7 ikidpwsq1vR/Q2kTYzJwYS5pY29uAAAAABhjMnNoWvL6/8awDFpLST4YBhZeWwAAABdiZmRiAGlt YWdlL3N2Zyt4bWwAAAAJd2JpZGI8c3ZnIHdpZHRoPSI3MTYiIGhlaWdodD0iNzE2IiB2aWV3Qm94 PSIwIDAgNzE2IDcxNiIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAv c3ZnIj4KPHBhdGggZD0iTTUwOC43NDkgMzE3LjM5OUM1MTYuNzc3IDI4Ny4zMTQgNTA4Ljk5MSAy NTMuODg0IDQ4NS4zODkgMjMwLjI4MkM0NjEuNzg4IDIwNi42ODEgNDI4LjM2IDE5OC44OTUgMzk4 LjI3MyAyMDYuOTIzQzM3Ni4yMzEgMTg0LjkyOCAzNDMuMzkgMTc0Ljk1NiAzMTEuMTQ4IDE4My41 OTZDMjc4LjkwNiAxOTIuMjM0IDI1NS40NSAyMTcuMjkyIDI0Ny4zNiAyNDcuMzYxQzIxNy4yOTEg MjU1LjQ1MSAxOTIuMjMzIDI3OC45MSAxODMuNTk1IDMxMS4xNDlDMTc0Ljk1NyAzNDMuMzkxIDE4 NC45MjcgMzc2LjIzMiAyMDYuOTI0IDM5OC4yNzRDMTk4Ljg5NiA0MjguMzU5IDIwNi42ODMgNDYx Ljc4OSAyMzAuMjg0IDQ4NS4zOTFDMjUzLjg4NSA1MDguOTkyIDI4Ny4zMTMgNTE2Ljc3OSAzMTcu NDAxIDUwOC43NUMzMzkuNDQyIDUzMC43NDUgMzcyLjI4NiA1NDAuNzE3IDQwNC41MjUgNTMyLjA3 OUM0MzYuNzY3IDUyMy40NDEgNDYwLjIyMyA0O